16|// Coverage gap (#494): the existing ScheduledJobInfrastructureTest only
17|// smoke-runs `zabbix:sync` against a real (missing) Zabbix. These tests pin
18|// down all three exit paths with a mocked service: unconfigured IDs, fetch
19|// failure, and the happy path. The command resolves ZabbixService via
20|// method injection, so we replace the container instance directly.
21|
22|beforeEach(function () {
23|    $this->seed(PermissionSeeder::class);
